WEBVTT

00:09.384 --> 00:11.845
Don't get thrown off! Hang on!

00:11.928 --> 00:13.179
Hang in there!

00:21.187 --> 00:23.481
I can do it! I will cut it off!

00:26.526 --> 00:29.696
Hinokami Kagura: Flame Dance!

00:33.241 --> 00:35.118
That demon didn't get hit.

00:35.201 --> 00:37.912
It's not over until the main body
gets beheaded!

00:40.665 --> 00:41.833
He's gone.

00:41.916 --> 00:43.168
He fled again.

00:43.251 --> 00:45.420
Where? Where did he go?

00:52.218 --> 00:54.012
You bastard!

00:54.095 --> 00:56.347
Don't you dare run away!

00:56.431 --> 00:59.017
Don't run from your responsibility!

01:00.643 --> 01:03.730
The demons kill and eat humans.

01:11.988 --> 01:13.740
Let's go! Nezuko, Genya!

01:18.203 --> 01:19.621
Why are you running?

01:21.706 --> 01:24.959
That's what you all have been
doing to the humans.

01:37.806 --> 01:39.766
Why are you demons

01:40.350 --> 01:41.935
so selfish?

01:43.853 --> 01:46.856
I call this
"The Swordsmiths' Agonies of Death."

01:46.940 --> 01:50.735
If I twist the sword here…

02:06.209 --> 02:08.795
You tried to kill
a small weakling earlier.

02:08.878 --> 02:11.923
Someone as small as the palm of your hand.

02:12.757 --> 02:15.426
How diabolical.

02:23.977 --> 02:26.980
And yet, we humans…

02:28.189 --> 02:29.732
have always been helpless.

02:35.697 --> 02:37.782
You just get in my way, so go hide.

02:38.908 --> 02:42.620
Damn it!

02:43.663 --> 02:48.835
Enough running, you shithead!

03:01.014 --> 03:02.348
But we will

03:03.266 --> 03:04.350
never give up.

03:05.351 --> 03:09.898
Demon Slayer: Swordsmith Village Arc

03:13.818 --> 03:17.906
Episode 11: The Connected Bonds:
Daybreak And First Light

03:40.511 --> 03:42.180
He's so fast!

03:42.263 --> 03:43.890
The hell with him!

03:48.269 --> 03:49.979
Damn it!

03:50.396 --> 03:52.065
We can't keep up!

03:52.148 --> 03:55.109
He's still got some strength left!

03:55.652 --> 03:57.820
We're almost at our limit.

03:57.904 --> 04:00.031
At this rate, he'll get away.

04:01.991 --> 04:03.868
Dawn is about to break.

04:05.036 --> 04:09.374
Kanroji's stamina will be depleted after
doing so many techniques in one go.

04:09.916 --> 04:12.001
And when dawn break, the demons will flee.

04:12.710 --> 04:14.295
We have to hurry!

04:19.384 --> 04:20.635
However…

04:21.803 --> 04:22.929
He's fast.

04:23.388 --> 04:24.222
Crap!

04:24.305 --> 04:26.557
He's going to keep running forever.

04:26.975 --> 04:28.393
Before dawn breaks…

04:29.102 --> 04:30.812
Before Kanroji collapses…

04:32.105 --> 04:33.690
I won't let him get away!

04:33.773 --> 04:35.275
We won't let you…

04:35.942 --> 04:37.610
win!

04:41.239 --> 04:42.198
Oh no!

04:42.323 --> 04:43.950
It's hard to stay on my feet.

04:44.534 --> 04:47.287
If only my left leg hadn't been crushed.

04:48.454 --> 04:51.124
No, I can't go on like this.

04:51.207 --> 04:53.001
I have to do something.

04:53.793 --> 04:54.877
Tanjiro.

04:56.879 --> 04:58.298
In Thunder Breathing,

04:58.381 --> 05:01.467
you focus on your legs the most.

05:02.176 --> 05:03.553
But you know what?

05:04.137 --> 05:07.765
We don't have as clear a grasp
of our body's dimensions

05:08.266 --> 05:11.144
and the shape of each muscle
as you'd think we do.

05:12.228 --> 05:14.397
"Only when you are
conscious of all of them,

05:14.480 --> 05:16.816
you will truly achieve
Total Concentration."

05:17.859 --> 05:21.821
My grandfather who raised me
used to say that.

05:23.406 --> 05:25.908
Circulate the air

05:26.534 --> 05:30.621
to every fiber of my muscles,
to every blood vessel.

05:33.583 --> 05:36.502
Build up the strength in one of my legs.

05:36.586 --> 05:37.879
Build it up,

05:39.464 --> 05:41.507
and then release it in a single breath

05:41.966 --> 05:44.844
like a thunderclap
cutting through the air!

05:49.682 --> 05:51.768
Found you! Don't dare you run away!

06:02.945 --> 06:04.363
Come on! Come on!

06:04.447 --> 06:07.825
This time with all my strength!

06:09.243 --> 06:11.204
I'll definitely…

06:12.830 --> 06:15.792
sever your head!

06:16.375 --> 06:18.086
Don't

06:19.378 --> 06:21.672
you feel

06:22.256 --> 06:24.801
sorry for me?

06:26.761 --> 06:29.639
Don't bully

06:29.722 --> 06:31.849
the weak!

06:50.326 --> 06:52.203
Your logic

06:53.037 --> 06:55.623
sucks!

06:55.706 --> 06:58.876
You shithead!

07:31.659 --> 07:32.702
No!

07:34.620 --> 07:37.999
This flame burns me, too,
because I eat demons.

07:39.041 --> 07:40.042
Tanjiro!

08:16.454 --> 08:17.747
Tanjiro!

08:17.830 --> 08:19.040
Nezuko!

08:36.599 --> 08:37.725
This is bad.

08:38.226 --> 08:40.520
My regeneration is slowing down.

08:41.771 --> 08:44.649
Zohakuten is using too much power.

08:45.775 --> 08:48.778
I must eat human flesh
to replenish my strength.

08:54.200 --> 08:55.660
I won't let you…

09:01.541 --> 09:02.792
I sense…

09:03.626 --> 09:05.795
humans nearby…

09:07.088 --> 09:08.589
I sense them.

09:09.924 --> 09:11.133
Hold it right there.

09:16.347 --> 09:18.516
I won't let you get away…

09:22.937 --> 09:26.774
Even if you run to the ends of hell,
I'll chase you…

09:28.067 --> 09:28.985
and sever…

09:29.777 --> 09:31.237
your head!

09:34.782 --> 09:37.034
How dare he threaten me?

09:38.494 --> 09:40.371
Where are the humans?

09:41.038 --> 09:42.873
After I eat those humans,

09:43.374 --> 09:47.837
I can kill that kid in an instant.

09:50.965 --> 09:52.174
There they are!

09:53.050 --> 09:54.802
It's food!

09:56.012 --> 09:59.599
One of the three kids is a demon,
and she's a nuisance.

09:59.682 --> 10:02.268
She's getting in my way.

10:02.977 --> 10:04.979
In the end, that kid's sword got stuck

10:05.062 --> 10:08.190
in my neck and didn't cut through.

10:08.274 --> 10:12.862
First, I'll restore my powers
by eating those humans.

10:14.530 --> 10:16.324
This is bad. Let's go!

10:16.657 --> 10:17.491
Right!

10:18.284 --> 10:19.452
Wait!

10:19.535 --> 10:21.829
I won't let you get away!

10:29.837 --> 10:31.130
Nezuko…

10:37.928 --> 10:39.096
Hurry.

10:39.972 --> 10:41.474
Must do it quickly.

10:41.557 --> 10:43.059
One more time.

10:44.477 --> 10:45.728
One more time.

10:46.228 --> 10:49.065
Kick the ground while using
Total Concentration.

10:51.525 --> 10:53.069
Tanjiro!

10:58.658 --> 11:00.242
Tanjiro!

11:02.870 --> 11:04.205
Tanjiro!

11:14.465 --> 11:15.508
A sword!

11:16.342 --> 11:17.385
Use it!

11:23.349 --> 11:24.392
To…

11:24.475 --> 11:26.560
Tanjiro, use it!

11:26.644 --> 11:28.354
Give it back!

11:28.437 --> 11:30.272
You've got to be shitting me!

11:30.356 --> 11:32.108
Don't use it or I'll kill you!

11:32.191 --> 11:34.402
I've only sharpened it up
to the first stage!

11:34.485 --> 11:35.486
Give it back!

11:35.569 --> 11:37.113
Tanjiro!

11:37.196 --> 11:40.116
Dawn is near! He'll get away!

11:42.493 --> 11:43.869
You brat!

11:47.081 --> 11:48.082
Tokito,

11:49.875 --> 11:50.709
thank you.

11:55.881 --> 11:58.217
I'm counting on you, Tanjiro…

11:59.051 --> 11:59.885
Sir Tokito!

12:00.511 --> 12:01.804
Sir Tokito!

12:02.763 --> 12:05.141
Haganezuka killed him!

12:05.224 --> 12:07.601
No! I didn't do anything!

12:07.685 --> 12:08.519
You monster!

12:08.602 --> 12:12.231
It's because of the poison and his fever.
Calm down, you two.

12:13.315 --> 12:15.401
Take it, Tanjiro.

12:24.827 --> 12:28.330
Everyone's feelings are in that sword…

12:30.082 --> 12:31.792
Total Concentration.

12:58.027 --> 12:59.570
Dancing Flash!

13:06.994 --> 13:11.916
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

13:11.999 --> 13:16.921
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

13:23.636 --> 13:24.803
I did it.

13:24.887 --> 13:26.639
I severed the main head.

13:28.057 --> 13:29.225
I did it!

13:37.107 --> 13:38.609
Dawn is breaking!

13:44.114 --> 13:45.824
This open ground is dangerous.

13:46.408 --> 13:47.993
Nezuko, run!

13:48.452 --> 13:49.286
Ru--

13:52.540 --> 13:54.667
I can't speak…

13:57.878 --> 14:01.173
No! Nezuko, don't come this way!

14:01.257 --> 14:05.177
It's you! You're the one in danger.

14:05.261 --> 14:09.265
The sunlight will get you.
You'll die if it hits you!

14:12.768 --> 14:13.811
Nezuko…

14:19.567 --> 14:21.193
Ne… Nezu…

14:21.986 --> 14:23.237
Run!

14:25.406 --> 14:27.324
Get into the shade!

14:27.825 --> 14:29.034
Nezuko!

14:35.207 --> 14:36.792
Run! Run for your lives!

14:37.710 --> 14:38.669
It's still alive!

14:39.253 --> 14:41.463
Even though it has no head!

14:50.139 --> 14:52.558
"Resentment" written on his tongue?

14:53.142 --> 14:54.894
The main body should've been "coward."

14:55.394 --> 14:57.187
The letter is different!

14:57.271 --> 14:59.064
COWARD

14:59.148 --> 15:00.482
I screwed up!

15:00.566 --> 15:01.984
I have to stop him,

15:03.027 --> 15:04.862
and finish him off!

15:31.597 --> 15:33.057
Shrink!

15:33.140 --> 15:35.100
Make your body smaller!

15:35.601 --> 15:36.977
Shrink!

15:42.483 --> 15:46.236
Even though the sun hasn't fully risen,
she's burned this much.

15:49.323 --> 15:50.407
Nezuko…

15:59.124 --> 16:00.167
This is bad!

16:01.627 --> 16:02.586
Someone, please…

16:05.005 --> 16:06.090
Genya.

16:08.759 --> 16:10.177
Tokito…

16:15.391 --> 16:19.895
There's no way they can get here
from the top of that cliff quickly.

16:21.897 --> 16:24.692
Right, the sunlight should've
affected the demon, too.

16:25.526 --> 16:26.735
It's not stopping him!

16:26.819 --> 16:28.654
He'll get those villagers first.

16:30.990 --> 16:33.075
If I carry Nezuko while going there…

16:34.410 --> 16:35.869
I won't make it.

17:13.991 --> 17:15.284
No.

17:17.536 --> 17:18.912
I can't decide.

17:30.758 --> 17:32.259
I can't…

18:14.968 --> 18:21.683
Tender memories come to mind

18:21.767 --> 18:27.106
Within intervals

18:28.565 --> 18:31.902
I still have the pieces

18:31.985 --> 18:35.531
Of a dream I had that day

18:35.614 --> 18:40.869
Even now in my heart

19:18.073 --> 19:21.994
I think

19:23.704 --> 19:30.252
It's the "present"

19:32.337 --> 19:35.966
that's important

19:37.384 --> 19:44.349
Let's keep looking forward

19:45.976 --> 19:49.438
The sun shines

19:50.272 --> 19:53.650
Brightly

19:54.109 --> 20:00.532
Bursting its fiery smile

20:01.116 --> 20:08.081
Saying that our precious bonds

20:08.790 --> 20:14.838
Will never disappear

20:41.949 --> 20:43.283
Sniff out his position.

20:44.785 --> 20:46.662
He hasn't gotten far.

20:54.878 --> 20:57.506
If the main body had moved away suddenly,

20:57.714 --> 20:59.424
I would've smelled it.

21:00.842 --> 21:02.219
He's close.

21:02.803 --> 21:03.845
Where is he?

21:03.929 --> 21:05.681
Find him by the scent.

21:06.765 --> 21:08.058
Find its scent shape

21:08.642 --> 21:09.726
and color!

21:19.027 --> 21:20.112
There he is!

21:21.196 --> 21:23.156
He's still inside that demon's body.

21:24.950 --> 21:25.993
I see.

21:26.493 --> 21:27.619
More!

21:28.161 --> 21:29.579
So I can see more vividly.

21:30.622 --> 21:31.790
More!

21:35.210 --> 21:36.503
Found you!

21:36.962 --> 21:38.463
Inside the heart!

21:41.591 --> 21:43.593
No! No!

21:44.177 --> 21:45.304
It caught us!

21:47.347 --> 21:49.558
This time is surely your end.

21:50.017 --> 21:52.978
You coward devil!

21:58.608 --> 22:01.987
Pay for your sins…

22:07.075 --> 22:08.744
with your life!

22:15.334 --> 22:18.295
Why would you steal from someone?

22:19.629 --> 22:24.801
Especially from someone
so kind to us blind folk.

22:25.510 --> 22:29.097
The master may be pretending not to know,

22:29.181 --> 22:31.141
but I won't tolerate your behavior.

22:32.184 --> 22:34.311
I'm going to the magistrate's office now.

22:35.353 --> 22:37.522
It's not my fault.

22:37.606 --> 22:39.816
My hands are to blame.

22:40.859 --> 22:42.944
My hands moved on their own.

22:44.529 --> 22:46.198
What is this?

22:51.286 --> 22:53.914
Is this my life when I was human?

22:54.748 --> 22:56.291
Why I am seeing this now?

22:58.460 --> 23:03.590
It seems you've also committed
murder and theft in other towns.

23:04.508 --> 23:06.009
There's no room for mercy.

23:06.593 --> 23:10.472
Absurd. Those are impossible
things for me to do.

23:10.555 --> 23:12.390
After all, my eyes are…

23:12.974 --> 23:15.393
You can see, can't you?

23:17.479 --> 23:20.273
When a masseur came to this court before,

23:20.357 --> 23:24.402
he faced the wall until I began speaking.

23:26.238 --> 23:27.823
Your hands are to blame, right?

23:27.906 --> 23:30.867
-These hands…
-Then we'll cut off

23:30.951 --> 23:32.452
both of your hands!

23:34.246 --> 23:37.124
Poor thing. You'll be beheaded tomorrow.

23:38.208 --> 23:40.377
I will help you.

23:41.962 --> 23:44.589
No matter what you say,

23:44.673 --> 23:46.633
the facts won't change.

23:46.716 --> 23:49.427
There's no point in silencing me.

23:50.554 --> 23:51.888
Is this…

23:52.889 --> 23:55.725
The time you pay for your sins

23:56.059 --> 23:59.271
with your filthy life will surely come!

24:00.063 --> 24:02.023
UPPER - FOUR

24:02.107 --> 24:03.775
…my life flashing before my eyes?

25:06.922 --> 25:08.048
We won…

25:09.257 --> 25:11.176
by sacrificing Nezuko.

25:12.510 --> 25:14.471
She was burnt by the sunlight.

25:15.096 --> 25:16.848
Even her bones are gone.

25:33.782 --> 25:35.450
Ne… zu… ko…

25:36.409 --> 25:37.619
Nezuko…

25:39.621 --> 25:42.374
In order to turn Nezuko back into human…

25:43.750 --> 25:44.709
I've come…

25:46.253 --> 25:48.880
I've come this far for that.

25:51.549 --> 25:52.717
Sir Kamado.

25:53.718 --> 25:55.762
Sir… Kamado…

25:56.304 --> 25:57.597
Sir Kamado.

26:01.101 --> 26:02.310
Sir Kamado.

26:02.394 --> 26:05.981
It's the "present" that's important

26:06.064 --> 26:13.071
Let's keep looking forward

26:15.031 --> 26:19.035
The sun shines

26:19.119 --> 26:23.123
Brightly

26:23.206 --> 26:30.005
Bursting its fiery smile

26:30.088 --> 26:37.095
Saying that our precious bonds

26:37.887 --> 26:44.811
Will never disappear

26:46.980 --> 26:47.897
Goo…

26:50.984 --> 26:52.110
Good…

26:58.033 --> 26:59.409
Good morning.

27:06.791 --> 27:08.209
Nezuko…

27:10.837 --> 27:12.339
Sir Kamado!

27:28.396 --> 27:29.564
Nezuko…

27:32.317 --> 27:33.651
I'm glad…

27:34.444 --> 27:37.572
Are you… all right?

27:38.990 --> 27:41.409
So… glad.

27:42.410 --> 27:45.663
Are you… all right?

27:50.543 --> 27:52.754
So glad… all right.

27:53.797 --> 27:55.090
Right?

27:56.674 --> 28:00.512
Yeah… Really… I'm glad…

28:01.346 --> 28:03.973
that you haven't turned to dust
and vanished.

28:11.773 --> 28:13.191
I'm so glad!

28:13.858 --> 28:17.779
I thought you were dead!

28:18.363 --> 28:20.573
I'm so glad, Nezuko!

28:21.116 --> 28:23.159
I'm glad that you're still alive!

28:23.910 --> 28:26.037
I'm so glad!

28:26.121 --> 28:27.747
So glad, right.

28:33.253 --> 28:36.381
You two, thank you for saving us.

28:36.464 --> 28:39.759
If Nezuko had died,
I don't know how we would've apologized.

28:49.477 --> 28:53.773
Good for you, Tanjiro, Nezuko.

28:57.193 --> 28:59.404
He reached his limit!

28:59.904 --> 29:02.115
Young Kamado, get a hold of yourself?!

29:02.198 --> 29:04.117
-Is he dead?
-You fool!

29:04.951 --> 29:07.328
Are you still there? Stay with us!

29:08.747 --> 29:09.956
I'm so glad…

29:11.666 --> 29:12.876
Nezuko.

29:14.794 --> 29:15.962
I'm so glad.

29:37.525 --> 29:38.860
I can't take it anymore!

29:42.322 --> 29:43.907
I'm sorry.

29:43.990 --> 29:45.992
I'm gonna get killed!

30:09.974 --> 30:11.351
I'm saved!

30:11.935 --> 30:15.522
Tanjiro and the others must have
severed the head of the main body.

30:24.989 --> 30:25.990
Toshikuni.

30:27.951 --> 30:29.035
I'm coming in.

30:30.787 --> 30:31.663
Oh, dear.

30:35.166 --> 30:37.377
What's wrong, Toshikuni?

30:37.460 --> 30:39.420
You made quite a mess.

30:40.004 --> 30:42.257
I see you've been doing your research.

30:42.799 --> 30:45.051
You can't find the book
you're looking for?

30:45.718 --> 30:47.554
I'll help you look for it.

30:48.137 --> 30:51.641
But before that, take a break
and have a cup of tea.

30:52.433 --> 30:53.810
Finally…

30:54.310 --> 30:55.770
Did you say something?

30:56.771 --> 31:01.734
Finally, there's one who can
overcome the sun.

31:01.818 --> 31:04.654
Good work, Hantengu.

31:05.154 --> 31:07.740
Well, you seem to be having a lot of fun.

31:07.824 --> 31:09.826
Is this about a book you read?

31:17.667 --> 31:19.377
Ma'am?

31:20.044 --> 31:23.047
What happened to your head?

31:23.548 --> 31:29.387
Now I no longer need to
search for the Blue Spider Lily.

31:29.470 --> 31:30.471
Ma'am?

31:31.055 --> 31:32.515
It took so long.

31:32.891 --> 31:34.601
But for this…

31:34.934 --> 31:37.145
In this thousand years,

31:37.937 --> 31:42.150
I've been creating more of my kin,
even when I didn't want to.

31:50.325 --> 31:52.785
A chosen demon

31:52.869 --> 31:58.499
that never even
appeared in the Twelve Kizuki.

31:58.583 --> 32:05.465
If I devour that girl,
I'll be able to overcome the sun, too!

32:05.965 --> 32:08.885
Murderer! Murderer! Monster!

32:08.968 --> 32:11.137
Master! Master!

32:11.220 --> 32:12.764
Mast--

32:26.444 --> 32:28.404
Thinking back,

32:31.032 --> 32:33.493
it all started a thousand years ago.

32:34.452 --> 32:37.914
It was still the Heian period.

32:39.540 --> 32:40.959
Excuse me.

32:42.085 --> 32:45.171
The medicine is ready, Sir.

32:46.756 --> 32:48.257
You quack doctor…

32:49.968 --> 32:51.177
Nevertheless,

32:51.260 --> 32:55.014
no one is better than
this fraudulent doctor.

32:56.599 --> 32:59.978
What will happen to me
if I don't drink this?

33:01.062 --> 33:02.647
As you know,

33:03.064 --> 33:07.402
your life will end
before you reach twenty.

33:07.902 --> 33:14.617
I am doing everything I can
to keep you alive as long as possible.

33:16.077 --> 33:18.538
Yeah, I get it. Enough talking.

33:21.374 --> 33:23.209
It won't work anyway.

33:30.842 --> 33:34.429
I want to destroy… everything.

33:37.265 --> 33:39.767
No matter how many examinations I have,

33:40.268 --> 33:42.729
or how much medicine I drink,

33:42.812 --> 33:45.815
the deterioration of my condition
cannot be stopped.

34:00.705 --> 34:04.625
You deserve to die, you fake physician.

34:06.085 --> 34:11.382
But I discovered the medicine had worked

34:11.799 --> 34:14.927
not long after I killed that doctor.

34:16.095 --> 34:19.098
My body was brimming with vitality.

34:19.599 --> 34:23.436
At first, I thought I gained
superhuman strength,

34:23.519 --> 34:25.480
but there was one problem.

34:26.856 --> 34:29.776
I can no longer walk under the sun
since that day.

34:39.952 --> 34:45.208
Somehow I knew that the exposure
to sunlight would kill me.

34:55.009 --> 34:58.346
I began to crave human flesh and blood.

34:59.180 --> 35:02.475
But I did not mind eating people.

35:05.645 --> 35:10.066
If they are in my way,
I just get rid of them.

35:10.566 --> 35:12.360
A simple thing to do.

35:12.902 --> 35:14.153
Hold it right there!

35:14.237 --> 35:16.656
You demon, who disturbs
the peace of the capital!

35:19.951 --> 35:21.244
Do you mean…

35:22.829 --> 35:24.455
me?

35:39.345 --> 35:41.556
I had gained power.

35:42.056 --> 35:44.183
The power of eternity.

35:47.645 --> 35:48.813
However,

35:48.896 --> 35:53.317
being restricted during the day

35:53.442 --> 35:56.487
was humiliating and infuriating.

35:57.155 --> 36:02.076
I desired a body that could
withstand the sunlight.

36:03.119 --> 36:06.497
I checked that doctor's medicinal formula.

36:06.581 --> 36:09.375
Probably because it was still
in the experimental stage,

36:09.458 --> 36:14.714
I did not know how to make the medicine
called the "Blue Spider Lily."

36:15.923 --> 36:21.095
It seemed that medicine required
an actual blue-colored spider lily.

36:21.679 --> 36:28.186
I did not know where it grew,
nor how to cultivate it.

36:29.061 --> 36:31.397
Only the doctor I killed knew.

36:32.148 --> 36:35.568
I could not find it anywhere in Japan.

36:36.944 --> 36:40.740
In order to become truly immortal,

36:41.407 --> 36:43.534
I had two priorities.

36:43.618 --> 36:48.206
To search for the Blue Spider Lily

36:48.289 --> 36:51.751
and to find someone
who can overcome the sun.

36:55.671 --> 36:59.467
And at last, I found it.

37:03.930 --> 37:07.808
Now that girl has overcome the sun,

37:07.892 --> 37:11.562
there is no need for me
to create more of my kin.

37:12.063 --> 37:17.693
Once I absorb her, I will gain
the ability to conquer the sunlight.

37:18.444 --> 37:25.326
I will get Nezuko and
become a perfect being!

37:29.455 --> 37:31.791
Tanjiro, you okay?

37:35.836 --> 37:38.214
Tokito…

37:40.091 --> 37:42.760
I'm glad you're okay.

37:43.261 --> 37:45.346
Thanks for the sword.

37:46.764 --> 37:48.724
That's my line.

37:48.808 --> 37:52.353
Thanks to you, I got back
what's important to me.

37:54.355 --> 37:55.648
What?

37:55.731 --> 37:57.358
I didn't do anything.

37:58.776 --> 38:01.612
It's fine. Thank you, really.

38:03.364 --> 38:04.991
Tokito…

38:06.367 --> 38:09.370
But still, how is Nezuko?

38:09.829 --> 38:11.497
Well, about that…

38:11.956 --> 38:13.624
You bastard!

38:16.752 --> 38:19.255
What about my sword?

38:19.338 --> 38:20.673
Calm down!

38:22.550 --> 38:23.801
Mr. Haganezuka?

38:23.884 --> 38:28.472
I'm asking what happened to
the sword I was sharpening!

38:28.556 --> 38:30.641
I used it to fight against an Upper Rank…

38:30.725 --> 38:32.685
Yeah, fight, and then?

38:32.768 --> 38:36.230
And then… Wait, what happened then?

38:36.939 --> 38:38.941
I was losing consciousness.

38:40.318 --> 38:42.361
-I picked…
-You broke it, didn't you?

38:43.654 --> 38:44.488
No…

38:44.572 --> 38:47.241
Just be honest and say you broke it!

38:47.325 --> 38:49.243
Be honest!

38:49.327 --> 38:51.203
No, I didn't!

38:51.287 --> 38:52.621
Hello? It's right here.

38:52.705 --> 38:54.457
I'll kill you!

38:54.540 --> 38:55.958
Nezuko, run!

38:56.042 --> 38:56.959
Run!

38:57.043 --> 38:58.169
Get back here!

38:58.252 --> 39:00.796
Haganezuka, calm down!

39:00.880 --> 39:03.007
-The sword is here!
-Wait! Get back here!

39:03.090 --> 39:03.966
I can't calm down!

39:04.050 --> 39:05.926
-No, no! Calm down!
-Everyone!

39:07.178 --> 39:09.388
Everyone!

39:12.600 --> 39:14.101
Miss Kanroji!

39:22.651 --> 39:27.573
We won! We won! We all won together!

39:27.656 --> 39:30.826
It's great! We're still alive!

39:30.910 --> 39:33.788
I'm so glad!

39:33.871 --> 39:35.581
So glad.

39:41.754 --> 39:43.589
So glad, right.

39:55.726 --> 39:57.019
Tanjiro!

39:57.603 --> 39:58.437
Yes?

40:01.399 --> 40:04.193
I'm so happy for you!

40:05.319 --> 40:09.240
Although she can speak now,
her eyes and fangs haven't turned back.

40:09.323 --> 40:14.578
I'm not sure myself,
but seeing Nezuko is still alive…

40:15.162 --> 40:17.289
I'm just glad that she's okay.

40:20.918 --> 40:23.087
I'm also glad!

40:23.671 --> 40:26.590
I'm so glad!

40:27.258 --> 40:29.218
I'm so happy!

40:30.094 --> 40:31.971
I'm so glad!

40:37.226 --> 40:38.394
Tanjiro.

40:39.103 --> 40:42.565
Thank you for helping my research
by providing the blood

40:42.731 --> 40:46.235
of the Twelve Kizuki and Nezuko.

40:51.031 --> 40:56.829
The man that Muzan turned into a demon
in Asakusa has regained himself.

40:57.538 --> 40:59.957
Thanks to Nezuko's blood,

41:01.083 --> 41:03.752
he is free from Muzan's control

41:04.336 --> 41:06.839
and is able to live on only
small amounts of blood.

41:07.339 --> 41:10.885
The mutations in Nezuko's blood
surprised me.

41:11.719 --> 41:13.345
Over this short period of time,

41:13.429 --> 41:16.640
the composition of her blood
has changed again and again.

41:27.026 --> 41:30.112
I have always been thinking about it.

41:31.197 --> 41:34.325
About why Nezuko has not
returned to herself

41:34.408 --> 41:37.495
and why she still remains
in her childlike state.

41:38.787 --> 41:41.874
It could be that in Nezuko's mind,

41:41.957 --> 41:48.005
she prioritized something more important
than regaining herself.

41:50.466 --> 41:52.593
Yushiro. Yushiro.

41:53.677 --> 41:55.638
Yes, Lady Tamayo.

41:55.721 --> 41:57.139
Can I help you?

41:57.223 --> 41:58.974
Would you summon Chachamaru for me?

42:03.812 --> 42:06.690
Chachamaru is ready anytime.

42:13.072 --> 42:16.575
Give my regards to Tanjiro and Nezuko.

42:24.875 --> 42:30.047
Tanjiro, this is entirely just my theory,

42:31.632 --> 42:37.930
but I think Nezuko may be able to
overcome the sun in the near future.

42:40.641 --> 42:42.017
All right!

42:44.019 --> 42:45.437
Is breakfast ready?

42:45.521 --> 42:46.564
Three, two, one!

42:46.647 --> 42:47.523
Take that.

42:47.606 --> 42:48.566
Yes.

42:48.649 --> 42:49.650
It's 8:30.

42:50.150 --> 42:52.611
-All right, take this.
-I'll carry them.

42:52.695 --> 42:54.697
-Thanks.
-Sure.

42:54.780 --> 42:55.906
I got it.

43:06.041 --> 43:08.294
Chief Tecchin!

43:09.878 --> 43:11.338
Kotetsu!

43:12.089 --> 43:15.843
Tanjiro wants to say goodbye,
since he's leaving the village.

43:18.971 --> 43:19.972
Tanjiro.

43:27.313 --> 43:29.523
Is your body okay?

43:29.607 --> 43:30.566
Yes.

43:30.649 --> 43:32.693
Thank you for everything.

43:33.193 --> 43:36.447
You even got this cart for me.

43:36.530 --> 43:39.658
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

43:39.742 --> 43:42.494
You really did your best
to protect this village.

43:42.578 --> 43:44.121
You have my gratitude.

43:44.204 --> 43:46.957
It wasn't my strength alone.

43:48.000 --> 43:49.460
It was everyone's.

43:50.002 --> 43:51.754
I think it's because of that sword,

43:51.837 --> 43:56.008
which connected everyone's feelings
for hundreds of years until now,

43:56.091 --> 43:58.469
that made it possible
to defeat that Upper Rank.

44:00.763 --> 44:01.930
Makes sense.

44:03.140 --> 44:04.808
How is your sister?

44:05.809 --> 44:07.102
She's sleeping.

44:07.186 --> 44:09.521
She fought hard and she's exhausted.

44:17.821 --> 44:21.367
Good. I'm glad she's all right.

44:22.576 --> 44:23.535
Yes.

44:29.416 --> 44:34.004
Kanamori, is that Hotaru
skulking about over there?

44:34.088 --> 44:35.172
Yes, Chief.

44:35.255 --> 44:37.049
What's he doing?

44:37.132 --> 44:39.551
I think he's hiding,

44:39.635 --> 44:42.304
but it seems he can't forgive Tanjiro
for using the sword

44:42.388 --> 44:43.931
during the sharpening process.

44:45.683 --> 44:47.976
How stubborn.

44:48.102 --> 44:50.854
Hotaru, come here for a minute!

44:53.607 --> 44:56.360
I'm telling you to come here!

45:01.657 --> 45:02.825
Hotaru!

45:03.575 --> 45:05.411
It's all his fault.

45:07.371 --> 45:09.206
Right? Isn't that true?

45:09.289 --> 45:10.332
-Right?
-Hey!

45:10.416 --> 45:12.709
I'm sorry! It hurts!

45:12.793 --> 45:13.669
Hotaru.

45:13.752 --> 45:19.174
If Tanjiro and the others hadn't come,
this village would've been destroyed.

45:24.513 --> 45:25.764
Hotaru.

45:25.848 --> 45:31.728
You actually want to thank Tanjiro
for coming all the way here, right?

45:35.732 --> 45:40.946
Mr. Haganezuka, thank you always
taking care of my sword.

45:41.613 --> 45:45.075
I came to this village to thank you.

45:47.411 --> 45:50.831
I'll properly rework the sword for you.

45:50.914 --> 45:53.000
So just wait at the Butterfly Mansion.

45:53.584 --> 45:55.085
You'll do that for me?

45:55.586 --> 45:57.838
Or you don't want it?

45:57.921 --> 45:59.298
Thank you!

45:59.882 --> 46:01.884
Yeah…

46:02.676 --> 46:05.721
Haganezuka, are you blushing?

46:07.014 --> 46:08.223
Kotetsu!

46:08.307 --> 46:09.641
Young Kotetsu!

46:10.184 --> 46:11.435
That's funny.

46:16.899 --> 46:21.069
I am not blushing!

46:22.279 --> 46:24.615
-It's because you say too much.
-I'm sorry!

46:28.243 --> 46:30.871
But, really, thank you very much.

46:31.371 --> 46:33.832
I'm going to work even harder from now on.

46:35.501 --> 46:36.793
Good luck.

46:37.920 --> 46:41.340
Well then, Miss Kakushi,
I'm counting on you.

46:43.926 --> 46:46.470
Now, we'll do the same
as when you came here.

46:46.553 --> 46:48.347
A blindfold and noseplugs.

46:55.979 --> 46:58.565
Take care, everyone!

46:59.149 --> 47:00.734
Godspeed.

47:00.817 --> 47:02.611
Be careful on the way!

47:02.694 --> 47:04.696
Come back and visit us!

47:05.280 --> 47:06.907
See you again!

47:21.004 --> 47:22.506
What's wrong?

47:27.052 --> 47:28.220
Tanjiro.

47:31.848 --> 47:33.308
Good luck!

47:33.392 --> 47:34.893
-Tanjiro!
-Tanjiro!

47:34.977 --> 47:36.853
-Thank you!
-Thank you!

47:36.937 --> 47:37.980
Take care!

47:38.397 --> 47:40.148
-Good luck!
-Thank you!

47:40.232 --> 47:41.483
Leave the swords to us!

47:41.567 --> 47:43.485
-Tanjiro!
-Thank you!

47:43.569 --> 47:45.988
-See ya!
-Thank you!

47:46.071 --> 47:47.114
Take care!

47:48.865 --> 47:49.992
Thank you.

48:16.351 --> 48:20.939
Let's go without the blindfold
and noseplugs until we're out, shall we?

48:21.023 --> 48:21.982
Tanjiro!

48:22.065 --> 48:22.899
Yes!

48:22.983 --> 48:23.984
Thank you.

48:24.067 --> 48:24.901
Tanjiro!

48:26.236 --> 48:27.863
-See you again!
-Thank you!

48:28.447 --> 48:30.657
-Thank you.
-Tanjiro!

48:30.741 --> 48:32.326
-Thank you!
-Thank you!

48:32.409 --> 48:33.452
Tanjiro!

48:33.535 --> 48:34.911
Take care!

52:01.618 --> 52:04.871
Demon Slayer: Swordsmith Village Arc
The End
